won't have a hangout that week.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:57.325
But I'm excited to get to meet
so many of you there in person.

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:01.420
But anyways if you're watching
this recording at some point in

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:04.480
the future on YouTube
and you are thinking,

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:05.950
I want to join them live,

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:08.530
you can use the link
below in the details

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:10.900
to add it to your calendar too.

