But at the hangout,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.530
we're all dedicated to
making this a welcoming environment

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:18.360
for everybody. And we love
to hear from everyone,

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:21.100
no matter your years
of experience, titles,

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:26.600
industry, or languages that you
work in too. And every week,

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.630
I'm joined by a different
leader from the community who

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.340
