he'll see me on Teams. He
goes, why are you on Teams?

00:43:02.360 --> 00:43:03.440
Go be with your
family. Go away.

00:43:04.130 --> 00:43:07.430
And so conversely, I'm just
like, you better be TUI, boss,

00:43:07.430 --> 00:43:10.140
because otherwise, why
are you calling me?

00:43:10.140 --> 00:43:10.640
- Right.

