time away from work.

00:43:49.740 --> 00:43:50.240
But

00:43:51.810 --> 00:43:52.310
the

00:43:52.770 --> 00:43:54.040
personal anecdote is,

00:43:54.040 --> 00:43:56.100
how many times do I
see a quick question--

00:43:56.100 --> 00:43:58.590
hey, I've got a quick
question on Teams.

00:43:58.590 --> 00:44:00.660
