I can answer that.

00:44:00.660 --> 00:44:02.160
And it'll only take
a couple of minutes.

00:44:02.160 --> 00:44:05.790
And I'll just help this
because that will unblock that person.

00:44:06.660 --> 00:44:08.310
So you just fire
off a quick, oh,

00:44:08.310 --> 00:44:09.690
this is where you
find that thing.

00:44:11.910 --> 00:44:14.830
But the other thing is
that if you don't do that,

00:44:14.830 --> 00:44:20.140
they don't sit there blocked
for the 24, 48, 72 week

00:44:20.140 --> 00:44:22.000
long that you're
not at the office.

00:44:22.000 --> 00:44:24.050
They find the
solution themselves.

00:44:26.350 --> 00:44:27.520
So it's almost like, well, yes,

00:44:27.520 --> 00:44:30.190
I've been very helpful and
I've answered this question quickly.

00:44:30.190 --> 00:44:31.255
But actually,

00:44:31.930 --> 00:44:35.650
I've taken my brain from doing
the thing that I was doing to

00:44:35.650 --> 00:44:36.760
answering a work question.

00:44:36.760 --> 00:44:38.545
And then I've got
to come back to the

00:44:39.910 --> 00:44:42.550
out of office brain. It's hard. KRIS

00:44:42.550 --> 00:44:43.210
SALING: I think
there's a--

00:44:43.210 --> 00:44:44.740
well, there's a big
part to that too,

00:44:44.740 --> 00:44:46.420
where it's like a
little bit of parking

00:44:48.100 --> 00:44:51.040
the wanting to be helpful but
also there are lots of people

00:44:51.040 --> 00:44:51.820
who could do this.

00:44:51.820 --> 00:44:53.620
There are a lot of
people who could answer this question.

00:44:53.620 --> 00:44:55.000
Or there are lots of people--

00:44:55.000 --> 00:44:57.580
